                                           rdfs:range xsd:positiveInteger .


###  http://purl.org/gc/hasTag
<http://purl.org/gc/hasTag> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                            rdfs:range rdfs:Literal .


###  http://purl.org/gc/hasTechnology
