                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.org/gc/SystemEnergies> ;
                              <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Internal energy of a system plus the product of pressure and volume. Its change in a system is equal to the heat brought to the system at constant pressure."@en ;
