###  http://www.theworldavatar.com/ontology/ontopesscan/OntoPESScan.owl#PotentialEnergySurfaceScan
<http://www.theworldavatar.com/ontology/ontopesscan/OntoPESScan.owl#PotentialEnergySurfaceScan> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                                <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Menon et al. 2023, ACS Omega 8(2), 2462-2475, DOI: 10.1021/acsomega.2c06948"@en ;
                                                                                                rdfs:comment "A scan of the potential energy surface along one or more coordinates. Not itself a computation - a container grouping one or more real gc:MolecularComputation individuals that together trace out the scan."@en ;
                                                                                                rdfs:label "Potential Energy Surface Scan"@en .


###  http://www.theworldavatar.com/ontology/ontopesscan/OntoPESScan.owl#ScanCoordinate
<http://www.theworldavatar.com/ontology/ontopesscan/OntoPESScan.owl#ScanCoordinate> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Menon et al. 2023, ACS Omega 8(2), 2462-2475, DOI: 10.1021/acsomega.2c06948"@en ;
                                                                                    rdfs:comment "The coordinate being varied across a potential energy surface scan - which atoms define it, and what kind of coordinate it is (distance, angle, dihedral)."@en ;
                                                                                    rdfs:label "Scan Coordinate"@en .


###  http://www.theworldavatar.com/ontology/ontopesscan/OntoPESScan.owl#ScanCoordinateValue
<http://www.theworldavatar.com/ontology/ontopesscan/OntoPESScan.owl#ScanCoordinateValue> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                         <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Menon et al. 2023, ACS Omega 8(2), 2462-2475, DOI: 10.1021/acsomega.2c06948"@en ;
                                                                                         rdfs:comment "The value of the scan coordinate at a specific scan point, with its unit - reuses gc:hasValue and gc:hasUnit directly, not redeclared here."@en ;
                                                                                         rdfs:label "Scan Coordinate Value"@en .


###  http://www.theworldavatar.com/ontology/ontopesscan/OntoPESScan.owl#ScanPoint
<http://www.theworldavatar.com/ontology/ontopesscan/OntoPESScan.owl#ScanPoint> rdf:type owl:Class ;
